``` Name:        Baseline - IoT base domains
    Purpose:     feeds command-and-control-new-iot-domain.spl
    Cron:        23 3 * * *
    Window:      -14d@d to -1h@h
    Note:        domains not seen for 14 days drop out and would alert again. Stays out of the
                 repo: it describes household devices' traffic ```
index=dns src_zone=iot reply_code=NoError query_type!=PTR
| eval q=lower(query)
| rex field=q "(?<base_domain>[^.]+\.[^.]+)$"
| stats min(_time) AS first_seen max(_time) AS last_seen by base_domain
| outputlookup iot_known_domains
